# Regenerative Medicine and Cell Therapy Center
- Language: en

## Services

### Vinmec Tissue Bank (VTB)

- Receive, process, preserve and store tissue and cell samples;
- Supplying tissues and cells to medical facilities, medical research and training facilities;
- Supply and exchange of tissues and cells with other tissue banks;
- Cooperate with domestic and foreign organizations and individuals in tissue and cell exchange; for the purpose of medical examination, treatment, training, and research in the fields of Biomedicine, Regenerative Medicine, Personalized Medicine/Precision Medicine.

